[28.401, "o", "WORKLOAD                                 REPLICAS  CPU/POD   MEM/POD   $/MONTH\r\nDeployment/orders-api (shop)             4-10      4         8Gi       $467.20\u2013$1168.00\r\n    \u21b3 container \"api\" requests 4 CPU: make sure it really uses it (run `cost --ai` for advice)\r\n    \u21b3 container \"api\" requests 8Gi memory: make sure it really uses it\r\n    \u21b3 scaled by an HPA between 4 and 10 replicas\r\n    \u21b3 usage sampled from 2 running pod(s) (point-in-time snapshot, check peak load before cutting requests)\r\n    \ud83d\udcc8 \"api\" uses cpu 15m / memory 48Mi (requests 4 / 8Gi): suggest cpu 30m, memory 80Mi \u2192 saves ~$463.47/mo\r\nTOTAL                                                                  $467.20\u2013$1168.00\r\nPOTENTIAL SAVINGS                                                      ~$463.47/month (99%) based on observed usage\r\n"]
